</div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 16.4.7; printed pp.504–505 / PDF pp.524–525"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowForWeak1Generic}\">\\(\\mathrm{LowForWeak1Generic}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HyperimmuneFree}\">\\(\\operatorname{HyperimmuneFree}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DNC}\">\\(\\operatorname{DNC}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_T\">\\(\\le_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"66cf1a1d2a020b74\" href=\"?note=66cf1a1d2a020b74\" title=\"43-df-low-weak1generic\">43-df-low-weak1generic</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"df08310d02ee0072\" href=\"?note=df08310d02ee0072\" title=\"43-df-hyperimmune-free\">43-df-hyperimmune-free</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"323b0a74dc337ecf\" href=\"?note=323b0a74dc337ecf\" title=\"43-df-dnc\">43-df-dnc</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>。量化的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 全定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowForWeak1Generic}(A)\\iff\\left(\\operatorname{HyperimmuneFree}(A)\\land\\neg\\exists f\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left[f\\le_TA\\land\\operatorname{DNC}(f)\\right]\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LowForWeak1Generic}(A)\\iff\\left(\\operatorname{HyperimmuneFree}(A)\\land\\neg\\exists f\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left[f\\le_TA\\land\\operatorname{DNC}(f)\\right]\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书16.4.7(iv)明确要求“not DNC”。不沿用16.4.9紧接着一行把not漏掉的排印错误；本条根据前一条完整等价定理录入，不据后文错行反转含义。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 16.4.7; printed pp.504–505 / PDF pp.524–525。本轮逐项比对来源陈述并人工核对类型、参数和去Remark条件；未声称机器形式验证或来源完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-low-weak1generic","status":"resolved","id":"66cf1a1d2a020b74","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-low-weak1generic]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-hyperimmune-free","status":"resolved","id":"df08310d02ee0072","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-dnc","status":"resolved","id":"323b0a74dc337ecf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-dnc]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-low-weak1generic","status":"resolved","id":"66cf1a1d2a020b74","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{LowForWeak1Generic}$、$\\operatorname{HyperimmuneFree}$、$\\operatorname{DNC}$、$\\le_T$ 见 [[43-df-low-weak1generic]]、[[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]、[[43-df-dnc]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。量化的